Package: MN2mrg
Title: Translate Monolix and NONMEM Models to mrgsolve
Version: 0.0.1.0000
Authors@R: c(
    person("Zengtao", "Wang", , "zengtao.wang@lilly.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = "Original author of the Shiny app"),
    person("Miles", "Samuel", , "miles_samuel@lilly.com",
           role = "aut",
           comment = "Tanslator to an R package"),
    person("Eli Lilly and Company", ,
           role = c("cph", "fnd"))
  )
Description: Automated R package and Shiny application toolkit for translating
    population pharmacokinetic and pharmacodynamic (PK/PD) models from
    Monolix and NONMEM formats into 'mrgsolve', an R-based ODE solver, for
    simulation and analysis. Provides an integrated workflow for
    post-estimation simulations including dosing exploration, sensitivity
    analysis, visual predictive checks, and forest plots.
